    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0603",
      "reading_order": 654,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 724.20873681,
        "r": 307.8483724181998,
        "b": 709.2828958877272
      },
      "content": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0604",
      "reading_order": 655,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 699.12273681,
        "r": 373.83057529789994,
        "b": 690.2273049280328
      },
      "content": "To perform the lockout switch test, proceed as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0605",
      "reading_order": 656,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405090003,
        "t": 679.1429567499999,
        "r": 316.60732984490005,
        "b": 670.2475248680328
      },
      "content": "Press the [A] softkey to select line A."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0606",
      "reading_order": 657,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405090003,
        "t": 663.6631092079999,
        "r": 366.6772961158996,
        "b": 654.7676773260328
      },
      "content": "Enter a rate of 400 mL/hr and VTBI of 50 mL."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0607",
      "reading_order": 658,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405090003,
        "t": 648.2430217259999,
        "r": 539.9786813131002,
        "b": 627.8876023380328
      },
      "content": "Press [START] and verify the 'CONFIRM PROGRAM?' message is displayed. If rate and VTBI are correct, press [YES]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0608",
      "reading_order": 659,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405089997,
        "t": 621.362946738,
        "r": 539.8031859369014,
        "b": 601.0075273500329
      },
      "content": "Verify fluid is pumping, the message 'PUMPING' is displayed in the line A status bar, and the line A LED flashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0609",
      "reading_order": 660,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405089997,
        "t": 594.4828717500001,
        "r": 516.1870062259,
        "b": 585.5874398680329
      },
      "content": "Toggle the lockout alarm switch up (ON) to engage the alarm (see Figure 5-2) ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0610",
      "reading_order": 661,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.57931804989994,
        "t": 579.0627842680001,
        "r": 539.9679245023002,
        "b": 547.247377374033
      },
      "content": "Press any key except [STOP], and verify an alarm sounds and the 'HARD LOCKOUT ENABLED' message  is  displayed.  Verify  the  infuser  continues  to  operate  until [STOP] is pressed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0611",
      "reading_order": 662,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.57931804989991,
        "t": 540.7227217740002,
        "r": 516.8947645364999,
        "b": 531.827289892033
      },
      "content": "Press [STOP] and verify the 'HARD LOCKOUT VIOLATION' message appears."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0612",
      "reading_order": 663,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.57931804989988,
        "t": 525.3026342920002,
        "r": 539.9915297260002,
        "b": 504.947214904033
      },
      "content": "Toggle  the  lockout  alarm  switch  down  (OFF).  Verify  the  'HARD  LOCKOUT VIOLATION' message disappears and the alarm stops."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0613",
      "reading_order": 664,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.57961685019987,
        "t": 498.42255930400023,
        "r": 211.9596959771,
        "b": 489.527127422033
      },
      "content": "Press [START]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0614",
      "reading_order": 665,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.39943064519987,
        "t": 482.9427117620002,
        "r": 539.9623468966993,
        "b": 462.64695283393297
      },
      "content": "Open the door and verify the 'DOOR OPEN WHILE PUMPING' message is displayed and the audio alarm activates."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0615",
      "reading_order": 666,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.39933104509986,
        "t": 456.0625371739002,
        "r": 256.3654045611002,
        "b": 447.16710529193296
      },
      "content": "Close the cassette door."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0616",
      "reading_order": 667,
      "section": "LOCKOUT SWITCH TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.39933104509986,
        "t": 440.6424496919002,
        "r": 352.0691486491,
        "b": 431.74701780993297
      },
      "content": "Press [NO] at the 'NEW PATIENT?' prompt."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0617",
      "reading_order": 668,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 409.27201,
        "r": 347.8629902899998,
        "b": 380.36290588772727
      },
      "content": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0618",
      "reading_order": 669,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 366.18275681,
        "r": 395.3073448608998,
        "b": 357.2873249280328
      },
      "content": "To perform the proximal occlusion test, proceed as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0619",
      "reading_order": 670,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405090003,
        "t": 342.1830171139,
        "r": 316.60732984490005,
        "b": 333.2875852319328
      },
      "content": "Press the [A] softkey to select line A."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0620",
      "reading_order": 671,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405090003,
        "t": 326.7629296319,
        "r": 366.6772961158996,
        "b": 317.8674977499328
      },
      "content": "Enter a rate of 400 mL/hr and VTBI of 50 mL."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0621",
      "reading_order": 672,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405090003,
        "t": 311.34284214990004,
        "r": 539.9786813131002,
        "b": 290.9874227619328
      },
      "content": "Press [START] and verify the 'CONFIRM PROGRAM?' message is displayed. If rate and VTBI are correct, press [YES]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0622",
      "reading_order": 673,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405089997,
        "t": 284.4030071019,
        "r": 539.8031859369014,
        "b": 264.1072481738328
      },
      "content": "Verify fluid is pumping, the message 'PUMPING' is displayed in the line A status bar, and the line A LED flashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0623",
      "reading_order": 674,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58031405089997,
        "t": 257.52283251380004,
        "r": 540.1134402483999,
        "b": 225.76708607973274
      },
      "content": "After  several  pumping  cycles,  clamp  line  A  tubing  proximal  to  the  cassette. Verify the 'PROX OCCL A/AIR' message flashes and the alarm sounds before three pumping cycles are completed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0624",
      "reading_order": 675,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58011485069997,
        "t": 219.24243047970003,
        "r": 540.0579629926997,
        "b": 198.8870110917328
      },
      "content": "Press the SILENCE key and verify the alarm stops while the message on the display continues to flash."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0625",
      "reading_order": 676,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58011485069997,
        "t": 192.3623554917,
        "r": 492.7267006714001,
        "b": 183.4669236097327
      },
      "content": "Unclamp the proximal line and press [START]. Verify pumping resumes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0626",
      "reading_order": 677,
      "section": "5.2.11 PROXIMAL OCCLUSION TEST",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58011485069997,
        "t": 176.88250794969997,
        "r": 205.9682519616001,
        "b": 167.9870760677328
      },
      "content": "Press [STOP]."
    }
  ]
}